    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῆτες</span></b>  (
			Ion.
		 acc. to <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			711.44
		</span></i>), 
			Dor.
		 and Hellenistic <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾶτες</span></b> 
		<u>IG</u> (v. infr.), <i><span class="en">
			<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
			346.6
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			711.45
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>this
			year</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸν σᾶτες ἐνιαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.256.9
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Gela</span>); mostly found in the 
				Att.
			 form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆτες</span>
		(q.v.).</div>
